<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 501-9 DECLARED V ENGLAND (172), 4TH TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 501-9 DECLARED V ENGLAND (172), 4TH TEST.</headline>
<dateline>LEEDS, England 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia declared their</p>
<p>first innings at 501 for nine, a lead over England of 329, on</p>
<p>the fourth day of the fourth test at Headingley on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: England 172, Australia 501-9 declared.</p>
</text>
